          <td style="width: 27pt;"><br>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 27pt; vertical-align: top;">(c)</td>
          <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
            <div>In April 2026, the Company was approached by the Federal Maritime Commission (FMC) due to the inclusion of the Company in an industry-related investigation launched, regarding potentially discriminating practices among carriers in respect
              of hazardous cargo. At this preliminary stage, the Company cannot assess the outcome of this matter, if any.</div>
          </td>
        </tr>

    </table>
